    <h2>Known gaps in this repository snapshot</h2>

    <ul class="docs-list">
        <li>
            External mod assembly loading is not implemented; the game directly
            initializes its built-in MainMod.
        </li>
        <li>
            <code>Crafty.MDK</code> is an empty placeholder project.
        </li>
        <li>
            Block behavior callbacks exist as SDK declarations, but a complete
            third-party behavior execution path is not established by the current
            context/loader.
        </li>
        <li>
            <code>IChunkGenerator</code> exists, but there is no generator
            registration service exposed through IModContext.
        </li>
        <li>
            Terrain generation is currently flat; terrain pipeline/noise/biome
            components are incomplete.
        </li>
        <li>
            CombatSystem and DamageSystem are empty stubs in the documented
            snapshot; several related component types currently hold data only.
        </li>
        <li>
            Launcher management libraries are incomplete; some service interfaces
            are empty or contain stubs.
        </li>
        <li>
            Vulcan source is external to this repository and local project
            references need adjustment.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Compatibility guidance</h2>

    <p>
        When documenting or building against the SDK, use the exact source version
        that matches the game build. Do not invent a NuGet package ID, manifest
        format, mod folder, lifecycle method, or API signature. If a contract exists
        but the game does not invoke it, document it as declared-but-not-integrated
        rather than supported behavior.
    </p>

    <h2>Source of truth</h2>

